<Page title="Privacy Policy" description="What data GarageRecoveryLab collects and how it is used." updated="November 24, 2026">
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> We use web analytics (such as Google Analytics) to understand which pages are read. This collects anonymized usage data such as pages viewed, device type and approximate location.</li>
    <li><strong>Affiliate cookies.</strong> When you click a link to a retailer, the retailer or its affiliate network may set a cookie to credit us for a sale. Those cookies are governed by the retailer's privacy policy.</li>
    <li><strong>Email.</strong> If you join our email list, we store your email address to send the content you asked for. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not ask for payment details. All purchases happen on the retailer's site.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can block cookies in your browser and still use this site. To ask about or delete data we hold about you, <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
</Page>
